# The private server: AzerothCore at the revision ChromieCraft runs, with the playerbots fork's core
# changes merged onto it, and ChromieCraft's modules plus mod-playerbots. Built for Linux arm64 (musl,
# Alpine) by scripts/build-azerothcore.sh. Pin the playerbots core and module together: their
# commits are made to match.
ALPINE_VERSION=3.22
CORE_REPO=https://github.com/chromiecraft/azerothcore-wotlk
CORE_COMMIT=4ce7da02a361af539f2ef33f43add70844672d77
PLAYERBOT_CORE_REPO=https://github.com/mod-playerbots/azerothcore-wotlk
PLAYERBOT_CORE_COMMIT=2a2211cd8f3d157da432ec0175ddd4b8a191931f
# Modules: name, repository, commit (one per line).
MODULES="
mod-playerbots https://github.com/mod-playerbots/mod-playerbots 79bd428115c8f33b74b13de23b133d49c3f75c60
mod-progression-system https://github.com/azerothcore/mod-progression-system a4e785ac0858c0c505ffdff3dbab173d6d344af4
mod-zone-difficulty https://github.com/azerothcore/mod-zone-difficulty f644224e8a52d99af38cd9aaa79bc7e937413f7e
mod-chromie-xp https://github.com/azerothcore/mod-chromie-xp 2c6c241c02ffc654f7737ede70df3aa98fd96623
mod-chromiecraft-smartstone https://github.com/chromiecraft/mod-chromiecraft-smartstone 120498b97325e59f7db935b99973afaf1ef5c9e3
mod-hoard-collector https://github.com/chromiecraft/mod-hoard-collector a44173ae7b3ced44c73185435bf0ce29af679ebb
mod-npc-talent-template https://github.com/chromiecraft/mod-npc-talent-template fd53ed5b2ef3e0c8dec065cfc9df486a51fd6706
mod-ale https://github.com/azerothcore/mod-ale 84b85cc55980dbf67d596f3d5cb34ded10c59102
mod-worgoblin https://github.com/heyitsbench/mod-worgoblin d1bf8fa04acc5979c74cd0438348a5685248f9a7
"
# mod-worgoblin (the Worgen and Goblins) is ChromieCraft's alone and goes in through the app's
# mod-worgen-goblin (warcraft/modules): its scripts are built as they are; its SQL, its tables and its
# files for the game are put in the way that module says (its README).
